    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "horse mackerel caught in autumn",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "脂が乗って丸々と太った秋鯵を、刺身となめろうで頂いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "市場の店頭に並ぶ秋鯵の輝きに、秋の深まりを実感する。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "秋鯵がよく釣れると聞いて、週末は友人と防波堤に出かけた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "それは熊がアキアジ（鮭）を担いでいる形の粗雑ながら陶の容器で、傾けると熊の口からコクコクと、香の強い美酒（？",
              "citation": {
                "source": "金山※話",
                "author": "大鹿卓",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
